hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"52","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa A'ishah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akimbusu naye amefunga."
"53","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa A'ishah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Nabii mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akimbusu naye amefunga."
"54","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa A'ishah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Nabii mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akimbusu naye amefunga."
"55","[AI-translation] A'ishah (Allah amridhie) anasimulia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akimbusu naye amefunga."
"56","[AI-translation] Umm al-Mu'minin A'ishah (Allah amridhie) amesema: Mwanzoni, sala ya faradhi nyumbani na safarini ilikuwa rakaa mbili. Kisha, sala ya safarini ikabaki rakaa mbili, ilhali sala ya nyumbani ikakamilishwa kuwa rakaa nne. Salih ibn Kaysan akasema: Nilimsimulia Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) hadithi hii, akauliza: Je, Urwah (Allah amrehemu) aliniambia kwamba A'ishah (Allah amridhie) alikuwa akisali rakaa nne [kamili] safarini? Salih akasema: Siku moja nilimuona Urwah (Allah amrehemu) akiwa na Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu), nikamuuliza: Umesimuliaje hadithi hiyo kutoka kwa A'ishah (Allah amridhie)? Basi aliniambia hadithi kwa namna ile ile alivyosimulia hapo awali. [Aliposikia hivyo] Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) akamwambia Urwah: Umeniambia kwamba A'ishah (Allah amridhie) alikuwa akisali rakaa nne [faradhi kamili] safarini. Urwah (Allah amrehemu) akasema: Ndiyo! Ndivyo ilivyo."
"57","[AI-translation] A'ishah (Allah amridhie) amesema: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akisali usiku nami nimelala kitandani mbele yake. Ibn Abi Habibah akasema: Katika riwaya yake, Khalid aliongeza maneno ((amelala kama maiti)). Na alipotaka kusali Witri aliniamsha nami pia, nami nikasali Witri."
"58","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (Allah amridhie) amesema: Aliulizwa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam): Mtu anajamii mkewe lakini hatoui manii? Akasema: ((Atawadha kama udhu wa sala, na ataosha tupu yake))."
"59","[AI-translation] Abu Musa al-Ansari (Allah amridhie) amesema: Jibril (alayhi as-salam) alimjia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) baada ya jua kupinduka akasema: Simama ukasalishe sala ya Adhuhuri rakaa nne. Kisha, kivuli cha kila kitu kilipokuwa sawa na urefu wake, akaja akasema: Simama ukasalishe sala ya Alasiri rakaa nne. Kisha, jua lilipozama, akaja akasema: Simama ukasali Magharibi. Kisha, wekundu ulipoondoka, akaja akasema: Simama ukasalishe sala ya Isha rakaa nne. Kisha akaja alfajiri ilipoangaza akasema: Simama ukasali Alfajiri rakaa mbili. Kisha, siku ya pili, kivuli kilipokuwa sawa na urefu, akaja akasema: Sali Adhuhuri rakaa nne. Kisha, kivuli kilipokuwa maradufu, akaja akasema: Sali Alasiri rakaa nne. Kisha akaja wakati ule ule wa kwanza jua lilipozama, ukasali Magharibi. Kisha, wekundu ulipoondoka na kukawa giza sana, akaja akasalishe Isha. Kisha akaja alfajiri ilipoangaza akasalishe Alfajiri rakaa mbili. Kisha Jibril (alayhi as-salam) akasema: Nyakati za sala ziko baina ya nyakati hizi mbili."
"60","[AI-translation] Ishaq ibn Ibrahim alitusimulia hadithi, akasema: Ayyub ibn Sulayman alitusimulia hadithi, akasema: Abu Bakr aliniambia kutoka kwa Sulayman ibn Bilal, kutoka kwa Yahya ibn Sa'id, kwamba Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz aliniarifu mfano wa hadithi iliyotangulia, isipokuwa katika riwaya yake alitaja maneno haya: Jibril (alayhi as-salam) akasema: Na hizi ni [nyakati za] sala yako na sala za Manabii kabla yako."
"61","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari na Bashir ibn Abi Mas'ud (Allah awaridhie wawili), na wote wawili walikuwa Masahaba wa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), kwamba Jibril (alayhi as-salam) alimjia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), na akasimulia hadithi mfano wa hadithi iliyotangulia."
